WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.470
Reading OCT scans in macular disease.

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:09.749
A systematic way to read retinal layers and spot fluid, atrophy and the signs that change management.

3
00:00:10.199 --> 00:00:13.716
OCT is the key test for both diagnosis and monitoring.

4
00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:18.183
It shows fluid in or under the retina and guides decisions at each visit.

5
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:23.359
Intravitreal anti-VEGF therapy is the standard of care for neovascular disease.

6
00:00:23.809 --> 00:00:28.348
Regimens aim to control activity while keeping the number of visits manageable.

7
00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:34.487
Low-vision aids, good lighting and early referral to support services help patients stay independent.
